@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-19 - View Order History

actor "User" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-19
FE -> API: GET /payments/user/:userId/orders
API -> Service: Execute View Order History
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách đơn hàng hiển thị

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Chưa có đơn hàng -> empty state
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập
Post: Danh sách đơn hàng hiển thị
Main flow:
1. User vào trang /my-orders
2. System gọi API GET /payments/user/:userId/orders
3. System trả về danh sách bills (orderCode, items, paymentStatus,\nfulfillmentStatus, total, createdAt)
4. User click vào 1 đơn để xem chi tiết
end note
@enduml
